          <li><a href="#section-1" target="_top" style="color: var(--primary); text-decoration: underline;">1. The Chemistry of Alkyd Resin Synthesis</a></li>
          <li><a href="#section-2" target="_top" style="color: var(--primary); text-decoration: underline;">2. Classification by Oil Length: Long, Medium, and Short Oils</a></li>
